<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!-- Beacon maintenance: retry quarantined sources so a temporary outage self-heals (Mondays, 05:00). Install + load with:
       cp deploy/com.beacon.probe.plist ~/Library/LaunchAgents/
       launchctl bootout  gui/$UID/com.beacon.probe 2>/dev/null
       launchctl bootstrap gui/$UID ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.beacon.probe.plist

     One launchd job per maintenance fire, replacing the APScheduler crons that lived in the
     always-on com.beacon.scheduler daemon until 2026-09-11. The daemon could not fire these
     on this box at all: a LaunchAgent lives in the user's GUI domain, so it exists only while
     logged in, and at 03:00-05:00 the Mac is asleep or logged out. Nine days of it running
     produced zero backups. launchd coalesces a fire missed during sleep into a single run at
     login/wake — the catch-up APScheduler's in-memory job store could not give — so a late
     backup still happens instead of silently not happening.

     Times are local (Asia/Jakarta on this box; launchd reads the system zone, which is also
     config.LOCAL_TZ). One-shot: no RunAtLoad, no KeepAlive. Each job is safe to run late or
     twice, which is what makes the coalesced catch-up sound.

     TCC: keep the checkout OUT of ~/Documents, ~/Desktop and ~/Downloads. A launchd-started
     job has no access there and dies before it starts — `Operation not permitted`, exit 126
     (proved 2026-09-10; hand-runs still work, because the terminal holds the grant).

     Paths are absolute because launchd has no working shell. Moving the checkout means
     editing this file. Tail logs at /tmp/com.beacon.probe.{out,err}.log. -->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>Label</key>
    <string>com.beacon.probe</string>
    <key>ProgramArguments</key>
    <array>
        <string>/opt/homebrew/bin/uv</string>
        <string>run</string>
        <string>--project</string>
        <string>/Users/tomtomtomtom/Projects/beacon/backend</string>
        <string>python</string>
        <string>-m</string>
        <string>beacon.maintenance</string>
        <string>probe</string>
    </array>
    <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
    <string>/Users/tomtomtomtom/Projects/beacon/backend</string>
    <key>StartCalendarInterval</key>
    <array>
        <dict><key>Weekday</key><integer>1</integer><key>Hour</key><integer>5</integer><key>Minute</key><integer>0</integer></dict>
    </array>
    <key>StandardOutPath</key>
    <string>/tmp/com.beacon.probe.out.log</string>
    <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
    <string>/tmp/com.beacon.probe.err.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
